articipate in Mini-Games. These are available after each Chapter and after completing the entire game. The Mini-Games are very diverse and sometimes not what they seem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/f6a1782f4be35ba06eb02f2362e78ecb.avif?t=1764544187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras_big/f6a1782f4be35ba06eb02f2362e78ecb.webp?t=1764544187 width=1560 height=845 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>EXPLORE:</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter offers different levels and different entities with different tactics to lure and hunt you. Explore the maps and search for clues that may prove crucial to understanding the level's mechanics and completing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/6fc88094b345f86c0ded4cd67cdf95f9.avif?t=1764544187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras_big/6fc88094b345f86c0ded4cd67cdf95f9.webp?t=1764544187 width=1560 height=845 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>ENTITY:</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some maps are for exploration, but the vast majority contain entities waiting for you. The game has a built-in microphone system, so some of them will be able to hear you through your microphone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/1ba88f414e52f53f07a50179a41fab8e.avif?t=1764544187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras_big/1ba88f414e52f53f07a50179a41fab8e.we